{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S08—S09压缩了部分心理因果，尤其从期待转向担忧的过程不如X交代得清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点加亮让人扫屏时更容易抓住每段核心，感受文字的小字号和随音乐分时出现，也让情绪变化更贴合听觉过程；感受描写在触觉、声音、空间和身体反应上都更细腻具体。X的优势是心理因果和段落之间的承接更完整，尤其S06、S08—S09，能更清楚地知道人物为什么产生下一步变化。综合而言，我更愿意选Y，因为它在实际听音乐时提供了更鲜明的重点和更丰富的即时感受，虽然牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "364eea91-600b-4439-8c11-604348494357", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T070847088451Z", "elapsed_seconds": 143.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:11:11.028532+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9b30bf491b83b3e61f67c0d4e041ee74de1348ceab04bcd6cfcd5056aabd1b3e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt